<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000875> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000402> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Act of Personal Communication"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Communication that the sender intends to be received by a small audience."@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An Act of Personal Communication is distinct from an Act of Mass Media Communication only in terms of the size of the intended audience. The use of media typically need not require that the communication have a large audience, e.g., a Radio Broadcast on an obscure frequency that you use to communicate with your best friend."@en ;
